     "type": "text-editor",
     "id": "675fd889",
     "text": "Mandarins Is a small citrus tree with loose-skinned fruit resembling other oranges but typically sweeter and less acidic than oranges. Mandarin has several varieties like Fremont, W. Murcott and Honey Murcott, that are varieties originated by natural mutations with other citruses.",
     "html": "<h3><span><b>Mandarins</b><br/></span></h3><h3><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 400;\"><span> Is a small citrus tree with loose-skinned fruit resembling other oranges but typically sweeter and less acidic than oranges. Mandarin has several varieties like Fremont, W. Murcott and Honey Murcott, that are varieties originated by natural mutations with other citruses.<br/></span></span></h3>"
    },
